id: github
name: GitHub Activity & Audit
version: 1.0.0
category: Developer Tools
author: Lake of Tears Community
description: Ingest organization repository events, pull requests, commits, and enterprise audit logs.
icon: git-branch
dag_id: ingest_github
default_schedule: 0 * * * *
docs_url: https://docs.github.com/en/rest
parameters[3]{name,type,description}:
  organization,string,GitHub Organization or Owner
  access_token,string,GitHub Personal Access Token or App Token
  events,string,Event types to stream (e.g. issues,pull_requests)
